@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Us - Classic Marketing Agencies</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">About Classic Marketing Agencies</h1>
    
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <h3>Who We Are</h3>
            <p class="lead">
                Classic Marketing Agencies (CMA) is a leading provider of comprehensive inventory solutions 
                designed to streamline your business operations.
            </p>
            
            <p>
                With years of experience in the industry, we understand the challenges businesses face 
                in managing their inventory, tracking products, and maintaining relationships with 
                dealers and suppliers.
            </p>
            
            <h3 class="mt-4">Our Mission</h3>
            <p>
                Our mission is to provide businesses with powerful, user-friendly tools that simplify 
                inventory management, reduce costs, and improve operational efficiency. We are committed 
                to delivering innovative solutions that help our clients succeed.
            </p>
            
            <h3 class="mt-4">What We Offer</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Comprehensive product management with categories, brands, and detailed specifications</li>
                <li>Dealer and sales agent collaboration tools</li>
                <li>Purchase order management for suppliers</li>
                <li>Employee and vehicle management systems</li>
                <li>Real-time inventory tracking and reporting</li>
                <li>Role-based access control for enhanced security</li>
            </ul>
            
            <h3 class="mt-4">Why Choose Us</h3>
            <p>
                We combine cutting-edge technology with intuitive design to create solutions that work 
                for businesses of all sizes. Our platform is built on .NET 10 and Blazor, ensuring 
                performance, reliability, and security.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card bg-light">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Quick Facts</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Founded:</strong> 2024</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Technology:</strong> .NET 10 & Blazor</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Industry:</strong> Inventory Management</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Headquarters:</strong> India</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
